le.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Well,hope you enjoy on both counts!</div> </div> </div> </div>I certainly did. I don't like to recommend those kinds of songs as game aides because the lyrics get in the way, tho. If that's not a problem, &quot;this will be the day&quot; remains my favorite piece of the series. It screams the return of the solars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T03:41:17-08:00","id":1292430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1291740-best-song-for-moment-of-solar-exaltation?p=1292177#post1292177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I certainly did. I don't like to recommend those kinds of songs as game aides because the lyrics get in the way, tho. If that's not a problem, &quot;this will be the day&quot; remains my favorite piece of the series. It screams the return of the solars.</div> </div> </div> </div>This Will Be The Day is also a favourite of mine. I don't tend to use music at the table but it really speaks to the themes of my game, as does Sacrifice. <br /> <br /> To me, Sacrifice reads like an Abyssal confronting a Bronze Faction Sidereal about the Usurpation and the ruthless pragmatism with which they've shepherded Creation since then, giving ground and spending lives rather than releasing the Solars to defend it, all to fulfill their vision of a safe and stable world ... and it's still a mess. <i>Was it worth it</i>? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T09:12:10-08:00","id":1292507,"title":"","content":"For a Zenith, I'd like to propose the &quot;Ode to Joy&quot;, the fourth movement of Beethoven's 9th Symphony. It's very inspiring music (I'd argue it's the most inspiring piece I know, but that's personal opinion), and I think it has the right mood for Zeniths in particular.<br /> <br /> For an arrangement, I like this version particularly as something to pace a game:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kbJcQYVtZMo\" data-code=\"kbJcQYVtZMo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/kbJcQYVtZMo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> The way it's set up, it builds up slowly over the course of a couple of minutes, until it hits the high point and the chorus kicks in, giving you enough time in-game to set the scene of Exaltation, and then deliver the critical moment just as the crescendo hits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-27T20:42:44-08:00","id":1292691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5JqY-6q-RNA\" data-code=\"5JqY-6q-RNA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/5JqY-6q-RNA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE2a8_Y3bkE\" data-code=\"JE2a8_Y3bkE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/JE2a8_Y3bkE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverla